# @name: aws | Get Instance Public IP
# @description: Retrieves the public IP address of a specified EC2 instance Group: AWS EC2 Commands. Template: replace placeholders before running. {instance_id} = The ID of the EC2 instance
aws ec2 describe-instances --instance-ids {instance_id} --query 'Reservations[0].Instances[0].PublicIpAddress' --output text